  "geographic_meaning": "Digital surface model in five bounded terrain proofs: bare ground plus vegetation canopy and buildings as observed by TanDEM-X between 2011 and 2015. It is physical relief context for CARTA Atlas. It is not evidence about vineyard land, planted parcels, growing conditions, ripening, drainage, climate or wine quality.",
